{"4752720": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "The Shimoda Rift", "steam_appid": 4752720, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>&quot;How dreadful knowledge of the truth can be when there is no comfort in the truth.&quot;</strong></i><strong> Sopholes</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the year 2194 it was decided to send the crew of MPV-426 into <strong>The Shimoda Rift</strong>. Take control of the vehicle and explore the strange and unsettling world beyond the imposing portal located on Planet Villapoto in the Shimoda System. Navigate treacherous terrain and difficult conditions while following the path of a reckless expedition.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4752720/extras/a32891449ae3369ad659621fb3fb79e8.poster.avif?t=1780970466\" width=400 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4752720/extras/a32891449ae3369ad659621fb3fb79e8.webm?t=1780970466\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4752720/extras/a32891449ae3369ad659621fb3fb79e8.mp4?t=1780970466\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Shimoda Rift</strong> features accurate vehicle physics and unique driving challenges, a haunting and mysterious world that defies reason, and the story of an ill-conceived adventure and it's horrifying fate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4752720/extras/96425a6af26fa3bf0dd07af4d77058d1.poster.avif?t=1780970466\" width=400 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4752720/extras/96425a6af26fa3bf0dd07af4d77058d1.webm?t=1780970466\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4752720/extras/96425a6af26fa3bf0dd07af4d77058d1.mp4?t=1780970466\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over thirty levels, including unique platform challenges such as elevators, rotating pipes, pistons, collapsing bridges and exploding Space Wraiths designed to test your driving skills and patience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Realistic vehicle physics require a considered and methodical approach by the player and provides a satisfying off-road, rock crawling, truck driving experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple controls and top down view make for an easily accessible experience, perfect for the casual player.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Storytelling inspired by ontology and the nature of being, reality and existence. The story is told without explict exposition, relying instead on environmental set pieces, symbolism, and player interpetation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Custom Dark Amibent soundtrack designed and composed by 4jane music creates a cimematic atmosphere and a deeper, artistic experience.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>&quot;How dreadful knowledge of the truth can be when there is no comfort in the truth.&quot;</strong></i><strong> Sopholes</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the year 2194 it was decided to send the crew of MPV-426 into <strong>The Shimoda Rift</strong>. Take control of the vehicle and explore the strange and unsettling world beyond the imposing portal located on Planet Villapoto in the Shimoda System. Navigate treacherous terrain and difficult conditions while following the path of a reckless expedition.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4752720/extras/a32891449ae3369ad659621fb3fb79e8.poster.avif?t=1780970466\" width=400 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4752720/extras/a32891449ae3369ad659621fb3fb79e8.webm?t=1780970466\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4752720/extras/a32891449ae3369ad659621fb3fb79e8.mp4?t=1780970466\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Shimoda Rift</strong> features accurate vehicle physics and unique driving challenges, a haunting and mysterious world that defies reason, and the story of an ill-conceived adventure and it's horrifying fate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4752720/extras/96425a6af26fa3bf0dd07af4d77058d1.poster.avif?t=1780970466\" width=400 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4752720/extras/96425a6af26fa3bf0dd07af4d77058d1.webm?t=1780970466\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4752720/extras/96425a6af26fa3bf0dd07af4d77058d1.mp4?t=1780970466\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over thirty levels, including unique platform challenges such as elevators, rotating pipes, pistons, collapsing bridges and exploding Space Wraiths designed to test your driving skills and patience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Realistic vehicle physics require a considered and methodical approach by the player and provides a satisfying off-road, rock crawling, truck driving experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple controls and top down view make for an easily accessible experience, perfect for the casual player.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Storytelling inspired by ontology and the nature of being, reality and existence. The story is told without explict exposition, relying instead on environmental set pieces, symbolism, and player interpetation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Custom Dark Amibent soundtrack designed and composed by 4jane music creates a cimematic atmosphere and a deeper, artistic experience.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p>", "short_description": "Discover the fate of a Moon Patrol Vehicle and its crew in this top down, off road, outer space, driving simulator horror platform game.", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4752720/48d0224d8cc9f2df0906da22983ea9107638b36d/header.jpg?t=1780970466", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4752720/d4449eec41a3c812233ae8362812c50b03671583/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1780970466", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4752720/d4449eec41a3c812233ae8362812c50b03671583/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1780970466", "website": "http://festivalofdelusion.com", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 (64-bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-8400 or AMD Ryzen 5 2600<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1060 6GB or AMD Radeon RX 590 8GB<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 10 MB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> Controller recommended</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 11 (64-bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i7-10700 (8 * 2900), AMD Ryzen 7 3700X (8 * 3600) or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Geforce RTX 2060 Super (6144 MB), Radeon RX 5700 (8192 MB)<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 10 MB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> Controller recommended</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "developers": ["Festival of Delusion"], "publishers": ["Festival of Delusion"], "package_groups": [], "platforms": {"windows": true, "mac": false, "linux": false}, "categories": [{"id": 2, "description": "Single-player"}, {"id": 28, "description": "Full controller support"}, {"id": 60, "description": "Gamepad Recommended"}, {"id": 62, "description": "Family Sharing"}], "genres": [{"id": "28", "description": "Simulation"}], "screenshots": [{"id": 0, "path_thumbnail": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4752720/ff03b225aad2a20ed55d7986296603b85c6a77c0/ss_ff03b225aad2a20ed55d798629